## Intent & Decisions
Allow gpu_count 32 and 64 so that one pool can span several nodes of one
NVLink domain for rack-scale expert parallelism. The inference API
decides which organizations can use more than 16 GPUs. The provider does
not copy that rule; the attribute description states the restriction.

This commit is the bottom layer of the stack, because the pd commit
above it uses the same seven values for the prefill pool.

