## Findings & Constraints
- The provider client has no protovalidate interceptor for inference
  (only container_registry uses protovalidate), so this schema validator
  is the only client-side gpu_count check. The older gpu_count rule in
  the pinned API module descriptor does not block 32 or 64.
- The values are useful only after the API accepts them; until then the
  API rejects 32 and 64 at create and update.

